# Walkthrough: Button Alignment & Text Cleanup

I have refined the product interaction area on the Pokémon card detail page to improve visual balance and satisfy the request to remove non-essential labels.

## Changes Made

### [Pokémon Card Detail](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/view_card.php)
-   **Removed "Authenticity Guaranteed"**: Deleted the secondary text label next to the stock status for a cleaner, more focused look.
-   **Unified Action Bar**:
    -   Set both the **Quantity Stepper** and the **Add to Shopping Bag** button to a matching fixed height of `60px`.
    -   Ensured perfect horizontal alignment by using `display: flex` and matching paddings.
    -   Corrected the centering of plus/minus icons in the stepper.
-   **Visual Polish**: Reduced the stepper's internal padding and added `display: flex` to the stepper buttons to ensure icons are perfectly centered within their white background.

## Verification Results

| Test | Status |
|---|---|
| Same Height Check | ✅ Both elements are exactly `60px` tall |
| Text Removal | ✅ "Authenticity Guaranteed" is gone |
| Center Alignment | ✅ Stepper icons and Button text are centered |
